--[[
================================================================================
SERVER FINDER & HOPPER WITH TIE-BREAKER CLAIM CONFLICT RESOLUTION
================================================================================
Rules Enforced:
1. Anti-Script-Conflict: If two players run this script, the lower UserId wins 
   the claim, forcing the higher UserId player to immediately hop.
2. Claim Range: Claims server when player count is between 1 and 4.
3. 5+ Player Hop: Auto-hops as soon as player count reaches 5 or more.
4. Target Search: Exclusively hops to servers with 1 to 3 players.
================================================================================
]]

